^(feat|fix|refactor|perf|test|docs|build|ci|chore|revert)(\([a-z0-9._-]+\))?!?: .{1,72}$
# Expected: <type>(<optional-scope>): <subject>
# Types:    feat fix refactor perf test docs build ci chore revert
# Applies to commits outside the four component folders (root, _bmad, docs, ...)
# Example:  chore(repo): track BMAD install
